{"title": "fis", "version": "v1", "page": 41, "body": "LINK TO LEARNING\n\nOne way to learn more about IS in cybersecurity and understand its importance is to play security awareness games. You can give this a try by exploring the Security Awareness Games (https://openstax.org/r/109SecurityGames) from the Center for Development of Security Excellence. The website also offers games, word searches, and crossword puzzles that can help you learn more about cybersecurity."}